# This repo only syncs the "Public stuff" and "Mohammed's Projects" folders.
# Everything else in this working directory is ignored on purpose.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!Public stuff/
!Public stuff/**
!Mohammed's Projects/
!Mohammed's Projects/**
!Kat-Projects/
!Kat-Projects/**

# Local venv, ignored even inside "Kat-Projects"
Kat-Projects/MQTT/

# OS / editor junk files, ignored even inside "Public stuff"
**/.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store?
**/._*
**/.Spotlight-V100
**/.Trashes
**/ehthumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini
# Office lock files (they exist while a file is open in Excel or Word)
**/~$*

# Python bytecode caches, ignored even inside "Public stuff"
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo

# Throwaway venv created by virtualTesting/setup_test_env.py, ignored even
# inside "Public stuff"
Public stuff/virtualTesting/test/

# Python virtual environment
.venv/

# Midterm opponent photo and its cached cutout: kept on this laptop only, not pushed
Mohammed's Projects/MT1 - A Little Ping Pong/opponent/chris_photo.png
Mohammed's Projects/MT1 - A Little Ping Pong/opponent/chris_cutout.png

# HW7 phone recordings with GPS positions (the Outdoor walk): kept on this laptop only.
# Trial folders are named ..._Outdoor_Tnn; phyphox names the zips after the experiment,
# so the GPS experiment's title must contain "GPS" (e.g. "Steps - GPS")
Mohammed's Projects/HW7 - How Many Steps/data/phone_raw/*_Outdoor_*
Mohammed's Projects/HW7 - How Many Steps/data/phone_raw/original_zips/*GPS*

# MT2 hand photos (hundreds of images, and friends' hands): kept on this laptop only.
# A few samples go in the project's media/ folder instead.
Mohammed's Projects/MT2 - The Impenetrable Safe/02_data_collection/data/
# MT2 photos taken while the webcam was (wrongly) in 640x360 mode, kept aside, not in Git
Mohammed's Projects/MT2 - The Impenetrable Safe/02_data_collection/data_old_640x360/
# MT2 stop-action movie frames (8 MB): kept on this laptop only; only the overview goes in Git
Mohammed's Projects/MT2 - The Impenetrable Safe/03_training/feature_maps/*
!Mohammed's Projects/MT2 - The Impenetrable Safe/03_training/feature_maps/overview.png
